@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+``str()`` on the ``ExceptionInfo`` object returned by ``pytest.raises`` now
+returns the string representation of the wrapped exception, i.e.
+``str(excinfo.value)``, instead of the traceback location, so it behaves like
+``str()`` on a normally caught exception.
